"""  <p style=""""
    font-size:1.2em;
    color:#CBD5E1;
    line-height:1.8;
    margin-bottom:36px;
  """">
    Building a centralized sales target management and performance analytics
    platform using Google Apps Script, Google Sheets, and a custom business
    intelligence dashboard.
  </p>

  <!-- EXECUTIVE SUMMARY -->
  <div style=""""
    background:#1c253b;
    padding:32px;
    border-left:5px solid #FF6B35;
    border-radius:14px;
    margin-bottom:55px;
  """">
    <h3 style=""""
      color:#FF6B35;
      font-size:1.65em;
      font-weight:700;
      margin-bottom:14px;
    """">
      Executive Summary
    </h3>

    <p style=""""
      color:#D1D5DB;
      line-height:1.8;
      font-size:1.05em;
    """">
      PT Consumer Products Industries required a centralized system for
      collecting monthly sales targets, monitoring field performance,
      tracking reporting compliance, and analyzing sales gaps across
      multiple regions.
    </p>

    <p style=""""
      color:#D1D5DB;
      line-height:1.8;
      font-size:1.05em;
    """">
      To solve this challenge, I designed and developed a cloud-based
      Sales Target & Gap Analytics Portal that enables Territory Sales
      Managers (TSMs) to submit targets while providing executives with
      real-time visibility into organizational performance.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- SECTION 1 -->
  <h2 style=""""
    color:#FFFFFF;
    font-size:2.05em;
    font-weight:700;
    margin-top:60px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  """">
    1. Business Challenge
  </h2>

  <p style=""""line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05em;"""">
    Managing sales targets across multiple territories and field teams
    was becoming increasingly difficult through spreadsheets and manual
    reporting processes.
  </p>

  <p style=""""line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05em;"""">
    Management lacked visibility into target achievement, sales
    performance, and submission compliance at both regional and national
    levels.
  </p>

  <ul style=""""
    margin-left:30px;
    line-height:1.8;
    color:#CBD5E1;
    font-size:1.05em;
  """">
    <li>Manual target collection process</li>
    <li>No centralized reporting system</li>
    <li>Difficulty tracking TSM submissions</li>
    <li>Limited performance visibility</li>
    <li>No real-time target vs actual comparison</li>
    <li>Time-consuming report consolidation</li>
  </ul>

  <p style=""""
    margin:32px 0;
    padding-left:20px;
    border-left:4px solid #FF6B9D;
    color:#FCA5A5;
    font-size:1.1em;
  """">
    As the organization grew, spreadsheet-driven processes could no
    longer support business decision-making effectively.
  </p>

  <!-- SECTION 2 -->
  <h2 style=""""
    color:#FFFFFF;
    font-size:2.05em;
    font-weight:700;
    margin-top:65px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  """">
    2. Solution Architecture
  </h2>

  <p style=""""line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05em;"""">
    I developed a centralized web application using Google Workspace
    technologies and a custom analytics engine.
  </p>

  <ul style=""""
    margin-left:30px;
    line-height:1.8;
    color:#CBD5E1;
    font-size:1.05em;
  """">
    <li>Google Apps Script Backend</li>
    <li>Google Sheets Database Layer</li>
    <li>HTML & JavaScript Frontend</li>
    <li>Tailwind CSS User Interface</li>
    <li>Role-Based Authentication System</li>
    <li>Dynamic Analytics Engine</li>
  </ul>

  <p style=""""
    margin:34px 0;
    padding-left:20px;
    border-left:4px solid #4ade80;
    color:#BBF7D0;
    font-size:1.1em;
  """">
    The platform serves as a single source of truth for sales targets,
    reporting compliance, and performance analytics.
  </p>

  <!-- SECTION 3 -->
  <h2 style=""""
    color:#FFFFFF;
    font-size:2.05em;
    font-weight:700;
    margin-top:65px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  """">
    3. Multi-Level User Management
  </h2>

  <p style=""""line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05em;"""">
    The application was designed with hierarchical access control to
    ensure each user only sees information relevant to their role.
  </p>

  <ul style=""""
    margin-left:30px;
    line-height:1.8;
    color:#CBD5E1;
    font-size:1.05em;
  """">
    <li>Territory Sales Manager (TSM)</li>
    <li>Regional Sales Manager (RSM)</li>
    <li>Office Users</li>
    <li>System Administrators</li>
  </ul>

  <p style=""""line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05em;"""">
    User authentication dynamically determines which dashboard and
    features are accessible after login.
  </p>

  <!-- SECTION 4 -->
  <h2 style=""""
    color:#FFFFFF;
    font-size:2.05em;
    font-weight:700;
    margin-top:65px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  """">
    4. Dynamic Target Entry Portal
  </h2>

  <p style=""""line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05em;"""">
    One of the core challenges was simplifying target submission for
    field teams.
  </p>

  <p style=""""line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05em;"""">
    Instead of entering data into multiple spreadsheets, TSMs interact
    with a dynamic matrix interface that automatically generates target
    entry grids based on assigned dealers, sales representatives,
    territories, and products.
  </p>

  <ul style=""""
    margin-left:30px;
    line-height:1.8;
    color:#CBD5E1;
    font-size:1.05em;
  """">
    <li>Auto-generated target matrix</li>
    <li>Dealer-wise planning</li>
    <li>Product-wise allocation</li>
    <li>Territory-level targeting</li>
    <li>Historical submission loading</li>
  </ul>

  <!-- SECTION 5 -->
  <h2 style=""""
    color:#FFFFFF;
    font-size:2.05em;
    font-weight:700;
    margin-top:65px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  """">
    5. Executive Analytics Dashboard
  </h2>

  <p style=""""line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05em;"""">
    For management, I developed an executive dashboard focused on
    performance monitoring and decision support.
  </p>

  <ul style=""""
    margin-left:30px;
    line-height:1.8;
    color:#CBD5E1;
    font-size:1.05em;
  """">
    <li>Target Volume KPI</li>
    <li>Financial Target Value</li>
    <li>Actual Sales Performance</li>
    <li>Gap Analysis</li>
    <li>Achievement Percentage</li>
    <li>Submission Tracking</li>
  </ul>

  <p style=""""
    margin:34px 0;
    padding-left:20px;
    border-left:4px solid #4ade80;
    color:#BBF7D0;
    font-size:1.1em;
  """">
    Executives can instantly identify underperforming territories and
    take corrective action without waiting for manual reports.
  </p>

  <!-- SECTION 6 -->
  <h2 style=""""
    color:#FFFFFF;
    font-size:2.05em;
    font-weight:700;
    margin-top:65px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  """">
    6. Gap Analysis Engine
  </h2>

  <p style=""""line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05em;"""">
    The most valuable feature of the platform is the Gap Analytics
    Engine.
  </p>

  <p style=""""line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05em;"""">
    By combining target data with actual sales records, the system
    automatically calculates performance variance across every level of
    the organization.
  </p>

  <ul style=""""
    margin-left:30px;
    line-height:1.8;
    color:#CBD5E1;
    font-size:1.05em;
  """">
    <li>Target Quantity</li>
    <li>Target Value</li>
    <li>Actual Quantity</li>
    <li>Actual Revenue</li>
    <li>Sales Gap</li>
    <li>Achievement Percentage</li>
  </ul>

  <p style=""""
    margin:34px 0;
    padding-left:20px;
    border-left:4px solid #FF6B9D;
    color:#FCA5A5;
    font-size:1.1em;
  """">
    The dashboard transforms raw sales data into actionable business
    intelligence.
  </p>

  <!-- SECTION 7 -->
  <h2 style=""""
    color:#FFFFFF;
    font-size:2.05em;
    font-weight:700;
    margin-top:65px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  """">
    7. Reporting Compliance Tracker
  </h2>

  <p style=""""line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05em;"""">
    A dedicated submission tracker monitors reporting compliance across
    all active TSMs.
  </p>

  <p style=""""line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05em;"""">
    Management can instantly identify which territories have submitted
    monthly targets and which teams require follow-up.
  </p>

  <ul style=""""
    margin-left:30px;
    line-height:1.8;
    color:#CBD5E1;
    font-size:1.05em;
  """">
    <li>Submission Monitoring</li>
    <li>Pending TSM Detection</li>
    <li>Compliance Tracking</li>
    <li>Real-Time Status Updates</li>
  </ul>

  <!-- SECTION 8 -->
  <h2 style=""""
    color:#FFFFFF;
    font-size:2.05em;
    font-weight:700;
    margin-top:65px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  """">
    8. Business Impact
  </h2>

  <p style=""""line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05em;"""">
    The implementation significantly improved operational efficiency and
    reporting visibility throughout the organization.
  </p>

  <ul style=""""
    margin-left:30px;
    line-height:1.8;
    color:#CBD5E1;
    font-size:1.05em;
  """">
    <li>Reduced manual reporting effort</li>
    <li>Improved reporting compliance</li>
    <li>Faster executive decision-making</li>
    <li>Real-time performance visibility</li>
    <li>Centralized business intelligence</li>
    <li>Scalable reporting architecture</li>
  </ul>

  <!-- CONCLUSION -->
  <h2 style=""""
    color:#FFFFFF;
    font-size:2.05em;
    font-weight:700;
    margin-top:65px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  """">
    9. Conclusion
  </h2>

  <p style=""""line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05em;"""">
    The PT CPI Sales Target & Gap Analytics Portal transformed a
    fragmented reporting process into a centralized analytics platform.
  </p>

  <p style=""""line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05em;"""">
    By combining automation, business intelligence, and cloud-based
    technologies, the system now provides both operational teams and
    executives with the tools needed to plan, monitor, and optimize
    sales performance effectively.
  </p>

  <p style=""""
    margin:34px 0;
    padding-left:20px;
    border-left:4px solid #4ade80;
    color:#BBF7D0;
    font-size:1.1em;
  """">
    The real value of analytics is not measuring performance — it is
    enabling better business decisions.
  </p>

</div>

"""
